  {"heading":"Compile all / Biên soạn tất cả","segment_index":"S9.P1","kind":"untrue","en_span":"chapters/reportfactory.qmd:168-168","tr_span":"chapters/reportfactory.vn.qmd:167-167","proposition":"The English names the argument `reports = `; the Vietnamese names it `report = ` (singular), which is not an argument of compile_reports().","reader_consequence":"A Vietnamese reader who follows the text writes compile_reports(report = TRUE) and gets an unused-argument error, or silently compiles nothing, instead of compiling all reports.","confidence":"high"},
  {"heading":"Scripts","segment_index":"S16.P1","kind":"untrue","en_span":"chapters/reportfactory.qmd:256-256","tr_span":"chapters/reportfactory.vn.qmd:254-254","proposition":"The English says the \"scripts\" folder holds .R scripts that are sourced by your .Rmd scripts; the Vietnamese says they are sourced by your .R scripts.","reader_consequence":"A Vietnamese reader loses the stated relationship between the scripts folder and the R Markdown reports, and may not realise the folder exists so Rmd reports can source shared code.","confidence":"high"},
  {"heading":"Outputs / Kết quả đầu ra","segment_index":"S13.P2","kind":"untrue","en_span":"chapters/reportfactory.qmd:227-227","tr_span":"chapters/reportfactory.vn.qmd:225-225","proposition":"The English gives \"epidemic_curve.png\" as the example exported figure file; the Vietnamese gives \"translate_curve.png\", a name that corresponds to nothing in the chapter's example report.","reader_consequence":"A Vietnamese reader looking for the exported epicurve in the time-stamped output folder is told to expect a file name that the example never produces, breaking the link to the earlier ggsave() step.","confidence":"medium"}
